# Durable archive of paid API responses (rustconv/sink.py). Streamed here as
# translations generate so a kill never loses paid work. Local-only, never
# committed — but DO NOT delete a run dir while its translation is in progress
# or unintegrated; it is the only copy of work you paid for.
.responses/

# semdiff reports + per-pair response cache (rustconv/semdiff.py). Generated
# output — regenerable, local-only.
.semdiff/

# Local manual backups (e.g. pre-c2rust response snapshots). Never committed.
.responses-backup*/
